title: "Azure Complaint Classifier"
abstract: "Multimodal customer complaint classifier on Azure OpenAI: transcribes audio complaints with Whisper, generates an image of the issue with gpt-image-1-mini, describes and annotates it with GPT-4o vision, and classifies it into a product category."
